## Python Instruction
Create a Python function that converts a given number of seconds into a more readable format of days, hours, minutes, and seconds.

## Python Solution
```python
def convert_seconds(seconds):
    days = seconds // 86400
    seconds %= 86400
    hours = seconds // 3600
    seconds %= 3600
    minutes = seconds // 60
    seconds %= 60
    return (days, hours, minutes, seconds)
```

